# Documentation updates

When changing user-visible behavior or architecture:

1. Update [docs/specs/PRODUCT.md](docs/specs/PRODUCT.md) if shipped behavior changes.
2. Update [docs/planning/FUTURE.md](docs/planning/FUTURE.md) and [docs/tracker/ROADMAP.yaml](docs/tracker/ROADMAP.yaml) for planned work.
3. Add an ADR under `docs/architecture/` for non-trivial decisions.
4. Ensure `scripts/validate-docs.sh` passes.
